\item Steigerwald, J., Geppert, A., Weigand, B., 2021. 
Numerical study of drop shape effects in
binary drop film interactions for different density ratios, in: 
Proceedings of 15th International
Conference on Liquid Atomization and Spray Systems (ICLASS).
\item Baggio, M., Weigand, B., 2019. Numerical simulation of a 
