Some possible future directions could be as follows:
\begin{itemize}
\item There is renewed interest in ``Rotating Detonation Engines'':
Jose I. Guerrero, Mirko Gamba, Quantifying combustion efficiency in 
rotating detonation engines using MHz-rate scanned-wavelength-modulation 
spectroscopy, Combustion and Flame, Volume 285, 2026, 114744, ISSN 0010-2180,
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2025.114744.
(https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0010218025007795)
\item The Physics of Fluids Journal has an upcoming special topics
 issue entitled ``Scientific Machine Learning and Physics-Informed 
AI for Multiscale and Multiphysics Fluid Mechanics.''
\end{itemize}

